[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Links in a grid table

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
[ANCHOR: THING-1, Thing]
Something.
<<<

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
+---------------------------------+--------------------------------+
| Link                            | Description                    |
+=================================+================================+
| [LINK: THING-1]                 | A link with the anchor title.  |
+---------------------------------+--------------------------------+
| [LINK: THING-1, Custom title]   | A link with a custom title.    |
+---------------------------------+--------------------------------+
| [LINK: THING-1, "Quoted title"] | A link with a quoted title.    |
+---------------------------------+--------------------------------+
| [LINK: THING-1]s and            | A link followed by a letter    |
| [LINK: THING-1]_                | and by an underscore.          |
+---------------------------------+--------------------------------+
<<<
